# Pod machine for the table's coffee slot (issue 168, redrawn after Marc's try): a small upright teal single-cup machine with a pale pod lid and a yellow lever on top, a dark spout over a tangerine cup on the drip tray, and a sky-and-denim water tank standing up at the back right. 16x16, drawn at table (46, 2); x 0-3 stay clear for the kettle behind. Light from the top left. No text.
